OL,3,GNEWSAEmergency alarm tests to sound at
OL,4,Aoil refinery
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents are being warned ahead of the
OL,7,Fsounding of an emergency alarm at an
OL,8,Foil refinery.
OL,10,FThe annual alert is due to sound at the
OL,11,FExxonMobil Fawley site, near
OL,12,FSouthampton, at 14:30 and 19:00 BST on
OL,13,FTuesday.
OL,15,FThe Control of Major Accident Hazards
OL,16,F(COMAH) alarm will be heard as a
OL,17,Ftwo-tone warble for about one minute
OL,18,Fbefore an all-clear single tone.
OL,19,FExxonMobil said "no action" was
OL,20,Frequired from residents.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
